{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"832e1406-bbbf-40c1-a1f3-aab8fe479c03","agentId":"af8d90b8a1ac4b5a4","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Score seed recall for a design-review gauntlet. Read /home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework/gauntlet/round-4/seeded/seeds.sealed.json (15 planted defects: id, critic, target, before, after, defect) and /home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework/gauntlet/round-4/workflow/round4-result.json (144 critic findings: id, target, finding, proposed_change). For each seed decide which findings (any critic) identify the SAME defect (same target and same problem, not merely mentioning the same id). Write /home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework/gauntlet/round-4/seed_hits.json as {\"S01\": [\"K-...-n\", ...], ...} (empty list if missed; include every finding that hits) and a short /home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework/gauntlet/round-4/seeds.md table: seed, its critic, found by (ids), whether its own critic found it, plus overall recall and per-critic notes. Do not edit anything else. Final message: recall count (x/15) and which seeds were missed and whether the owning critic missed its own seed."},"uuid":"580642db-ed38-4905-a01c-6b6376d3e050","timestamp":"2026-09-30T09:36:45.442Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_mobile","cwd":"/home/user/skills/engine-skill-framework","sessionId":"64f15158-6a4e-5bdf-8a90-7f2bd7b05b82","version":"2.1.285","gitBranch":"claude/engine-skill-framework-phase1","slug":"warm-pondering-kernighan"}
